{"4776500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Carry On Together", "steam_appid": 4776500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry On Together is an online co-op moving game for up to 4 players, where you build a small delivery company with your friends and every job can turn into chaos. Break the furniture, crash the truck, lose all your earnings or hold it together as a team. Can you keep the company alive?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4776500/extras/164b62c23617db46e7bb90117be1dcb1.poster.avif?t=1787230282\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4776500/extras/164b62c23617db46e7bb90117be1dcb1.webm?t=1787230282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4776500/extras/164b62c23617db46e7bb90117be1dcb1.mp4?t=1787230282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MOVING</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some items can't be moved alone. Stretch out your arms, sync up with your teammate and lift together. Watch out for tight corridors, slippery stairs — and your troll friends.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4776500/extras/79e32fecc3f616235592068ba71f5004.poster.avif?t=1787230282\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4776500/extras/79e32fecc3f616235592068ba71f5004.webm?t=1787230282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4776500/extras/79e32fecc3f616235592068ba71f5004.mp4?t=1787230282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DRIVING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enjoy the view before or after the job — but stay alert. The road might be the most dangerous part of the delivery. Do you trust your driver?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4776500/extras/589c41da38ba9713ab6296fa9d7c2a5f.poster.avif?t=1787230282\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4776500/extras/589c41da38ba9713ab6296fa9d7c2a5f.webm?t=1787230282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4776500/extras/589c41da38ba9713ab6296fa9d7c2a5f.mp4?t=1787230282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LOCATIONS</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the wide gardens of suburban houses to multi-story office buildings, from narrow apartment corridors to mountain dirt roads — every location brings its own chaos. Fit it in the elevator, move the rock off the path, squeeze it through the garden gate. Every delivery creates its own disaster.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4776500/extras/2515ee093807b8a73ec9eba976c9bc4d.poster.avif?t=1787230282\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4776500/extras/2515ee093807b8a73ec9eba976c9bc4d.webm?t=1787230282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4776500/extras/2515ee093807b8a73ec9eba976c9bc4d.mp4?t=1787230282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry On Together is an online co-op moving game for up to 4 players, where you build a small delivery company with your friends and every job can turn into chaos. Break the furniture, crash the truck, lose all your earnings or hold it together as a team. Can you keep the company alive?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4776500/extras/164b62c23617db46e7bb90117be1dcb1.poster.avif?t=1787230282\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4776500/extras/164b62c23617db46e7bb90117be1dcb1.webm?t=1787230282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4776500/extras/164b62c23617db46e7bb90117be1dcb1.mp4?t=1787230282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MOVING</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some items can't be moved alone. Stretch out your arms, sync up with your teammate and lift together. Watch out for tight corridors, slippery stairs — and your troll friends.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4776500/extras/79e32fecc3f616235592068ba71f5004.poster.avif?t=1787230282\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4776500/extras/79e32fecc3f616235592068ba71f5004.webm?t=1787230282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4776500/extras/79e32fecc3f616235592068ba71f5004.mp4?t=1787230282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DRIVING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enjoy the view before or after the job — but stay alert. The road might be the most dangerous part of the delivery. Do you trust your driver?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster